From 7671a5e51bc1cb51a287334778abdf0fcc0753f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:17:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] chore(google-sign-in): demo build of the example (not for
 upstream)

Demo only, for bats-lang/quire#316: the package
io.github.batslang.googlesignindemo (its own Android OAuth client),
Quire's Web client ID and the drive.appdata scope, and the debug build
signed with a throwaway demo keystore so its SHA-1 is stable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018S9SSb4Tp2je7dyuBCEXQ2
